+    ``token_ids`` are global. The softmax normalizer is reduced across ranks and only the selected
+    logits are exchanged, so no rank materializes the full vocabulary. The fp32 workspace stays
+    ``O(chunk_size * V_local)`` in forward and backward (the softmax is recomputed in backward).
+    Outputs are replicated across ranks; the returned gradient is this rank's shard only, because the
+    replicated loss must not be all-reduced a second time (that would scale it by the world size).
+    """
+
+    @staticmethod
+    def forward(ctx, logits, token_ids, process_group, vocab_size, chunk_size):
+        n, local_vocab = logits.shape
